error[E0303]: linear variable `act` is used more than once
  --> tests/cirkalang/fail/own/holder_action.cirka:14:5
   |
11 |   let act = useIO (MkTok 3) in
   |                   --------- its value holds this linear value
...
13 |     act
   |     --- first use
14 |     act
   |     ^^^
   = note: `act` is linear because its value holds a linear value
   = help: use it only once, or make it a function that creates the linear value at each call
